  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b48b9be5d5cc6bf6879e3e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽以“来自地方的英雄”身份备受瞩目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7384e166eb8cee030f74067df186208f2187d18301eb61cc8c87da19db6aa2a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7fa2ddae82c542fe7e259d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "将在“天皇赏（秋）”上\n与小栗帽对决的超级溪流，\n则被世人当成了坏蛋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad63d15709d2fa1be85ba72bda59b2dd11663043a54687c6ba216c21b0f29dc3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5896d05b22394ccda46c3d02",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "超级溪流回应世人的期待，\n决定以坏蛋的身份出赛，\n并且宣告自己将会打败小栗帽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52c26ef4512afbf5aeffc2cd5fb1906dda57a816a35b7044d09fb203c2c6e636",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3c29fd673b99d570b70132e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "超级坏蛋诞生",
      "source_fingerprint": "2449d18f9f222a9a9092fd3012cac7f237ead6c5d348a3507a88d50bd520b4f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56943edd251bfe82b7f36571",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“天皇赏（秋）”上扮演坏蛋后，\n即使过了好一段时间，\n超级溪流仍维持着这个角色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e079d6531aed67669d6733aaef6a67c0fac1e80e264c1baf5e27ee0688a92ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65a103cd5110fa09c04c9f17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她的努力没有奏效，从她身上流露出的\n温柔个性开始广为人知。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1c5bade8620869a836df0e1d5ba8f6d8d7703699adb6515658f29d8d44415a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cd843d5c60ff429e89e04f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在年末的决战前渐渐形成一股氛围……\n让超级溪流能以原本的自己出赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75df633d0f7fae2d173249ddf87ee957a5832a2ff256a1a44a44e93a0006dfb6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce584efe8c060b5b892b26bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "开始改变的风",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdb185eb0829003d030d72c9cdc660efaa03f7456a076bcfcbebfb301a5a7314",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a353c7d31386da39ca949a4a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在夏季集训开始前，超级溪流开心地说着\n要在这个夏天好好溺爱训练员一番。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7885b4eb00b0cab69bc3081bf7c388e8ffc432c0394643fc7b75639c9bab623f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bd435104c8d65cbe62e1afc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "并且也想试着掌握脱离低潮的契机。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07db9e507c216f7776949b5ff62c006c39f9359ffc9d4074fea124d565aa669d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41bbb5b6c4381843d8788750",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "已经推断出她为何会陷入低潮的训练员……\n下定决心要改变她的想法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a585589a216650893bedc62feb7c42328e2995b8c32f4717d1e40a05e844eb62",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39bd6123a02da9ac8d559527",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7edcdb0809e6c8c090abbc54",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与超级溪流一起度过的夏日再次到来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68dd3bba09e97f22799be61751695bf56923a57a62aecad0dc9f65c3645c6c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8225de8662c28c58def89f68",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她深刻体会到训练员跟去年比起来\n确实成长了许多，因此沉浸在感叹之中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa25551da531544fb2d370dd1a48b62ff6b572a794bfb45025adac2a5e755463",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20214d8cadf3dc7383df1ed7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以秋季比赛为目标……\n有了不输给真正家人的“情谊”后，\n两人开始展开最后的夏季集训！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5790569c1bd0ec0cb545383a9d79bf00ac036adf3fb51d1bb7b7fbdb9f61129",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b05b02adda44c63a43d077",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第三年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef37080660583492caac78b957b8f144bbb2896156162385fc6034f5649e4df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f60e6572454de6f1d74bfa2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于到了超级溪流参加\n“出道战”的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1caf39ff13c8613b39f6fb5d3e41d55f0f5d44ffb1bb9fad0ab802d5bd4b3356",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1249ee20e8c3b252e42c7141",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她把自己的出道放在一旁，\n为“训练员”的出道而欣喜着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46a49fad0b6147ba0608343adff1998bb3e3ad90116d4b1fea9fab6e46fc989d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a721ee680c4587234d14b589",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但当她想起要参赛的人是自己后，\n虽然感到害臊，但为了回应训练员的\n期待……超级溪流迎向赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3c8325df943ab5eb423c67ea8ac44cbe833d3ea482414e23d826efccc9a9d1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abbbed0b630caaf89cb8a226",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae0ad85c4423976c2949cbda",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了“堇锦标”当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2715646aab56645993a795bc17bcef177e27cd6fadedd1dfd86d6086dc5a73d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9286dacc7bdad2d9ea8e6d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本来是场拿出实力就可轻松获胜的比赛……\n但超级溪流的身体却在比赛前出了问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1edaccec62214d68502b27efe6dd4649b6ead105cf96e7225165e6e8e5259278",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46c85d9422ebc0c8d1fc3fc4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小睡一下后，身体终于好转的她赶赴赛场，\n并立誓要让胜利之花绽放。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e867a39e02282d4e926a793c9818c79d5b7e80df13595a0cc0d5021d9ab13dea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:835add63f294cb32a9a4bf15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向堇锦标",
      "source_fingerprint": "3711f5d42f02e9144dc741fd79b84072bbffc5d2d99173b94195aba7db66bc29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d42a787eba726807ec1a16b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在经典三冠中，据说只有“最强赛马娘”\n才能获胜的“菊花赏”当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d01f6ec239f6b936026305c2ecf3c58e93aaf1e178549b8dce6fe51e6d81ad7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4232057195f2055b9b6d3932",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员对超级溪流的“实力”表示肯定，\n想要送她前往赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f32494048901628673d8114cc296275be1128d085dc2e54b34b34c62c0364125",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db6800f91fbfb126378c11e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她却回说比起“实力”，\n两人的“坚固情谊”才是最重要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9870a9ae481777c9bf7ecfca05164bb37d95e2f5c6770e4f654729c054c947c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:759e27b36ef014ea0e2d988f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在表明自己将证明这件事后，\n她宛如摆脱束缚至今的枷锁，\n以清爽的表情前往会场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdb620894d9397f2bd7cc04a09d1ad0bd681dda2f813dd97aefc12c4bdab6809",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37ece2493f3cf666370c2720",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向菊花赏",
