    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7f7be56cf867f27169877e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跨越这充满烦恼的一年，\n超级溪流……往她终于抵达的大舞台前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b217a0b34879e5b7281e9ba6801602538bbde688ac097361c51e47efa184f4e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
