    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edb8fa65a5ada663866520fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时玉藻十字过来激励超级溪流，\n并说她十分期待在春季“天皇赏”的决战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be19bee3081108e08df4c9b17eda332eb5ca3603f6d1cd22a6d420e0f38116cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b6f94dacb4b87136ed6a51d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "超级溪流为了回应她的期待而前去参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f3b2a4ff5b861bb6f2e53edbc07552e3f8051a4cc2f381af912bd388d7efaaf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
