      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（春）”当天，\n玉藻十字来找超级溪流的麻烦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf8b1be609ce06b61b66dc5424ab22394d7def0aa4fb1089b675ced95c5715d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b490af8ade2a848bab88f59f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且还对训练员挑衅，\n说“要让训练员再也爬不起来”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a95dd8576133cc90dd7e988738a19878c28ba48996030df3e0ae552d7cb3faae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:470cf264754eaf0409a966ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "超级溪流为了不让她\n伤害训练员而燃起心中斗志，\n前去与玉藻十字一决胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dd7322966a90984a5f17bf2c97bc681ff73c2478b0c04c41dcaf717bda26ee9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045413.json",
      "json_path": [
