    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:022f30e306d6ec46e39ba39f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了让训练员成为“世界第一”的训练员，\n超级溪流来到有马纪念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "240ba110d90f713391de85bf78db5baef9b04c74a4016b966528bcfbc71bbba1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbb4a856432b229c8db6b317",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "整个会场对超级溪流与训练员的声援\n有如雨水般倾注而下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2980d3446fcfd40faa0dfe095c75cef9b7230640e424c35f58a4c5ba48ed3c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87b748b142a1f04944c919a7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赌上与训练员一同累积至今的一切，\n超级溪流降临于这个大舞台上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3e68b8819db5a19ef0daed1d15311df928665b347ae6113d36102f2bb47a8d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81ec4d265d718a7865339211",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:953c3f2e36b288cffea981e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "超级溪流以不让训练员蒙羞的帅气奔驰，\n跑完了“出道战”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1251e58bd32aca2572b735621ec4a1334c0dae4964038c69fb5edaa1f2ffebe4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93e80287404c6879dd721340",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后，将目标定为经典路线的她，\n以名字很可爱为理由，而决定\n下一场比赛要出战“堇S”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a0da57558bd06c9478d8a4843b06ba069925dbcace0849070692279dc656d48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a2d1c34e356ffc3dc5d22c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・最初的奖励",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1ffa39f0be85c3017688f40d23c7c206f4ad434a1fa25b587d80c974892b044",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
