    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bf6b667ff41207c81368e72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在身体状况不佳的情况下，\n超级溪流跑完了比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e60ad9ae95e5b5841f6b30779b7c0bd4e55a099991b234287b51cf4fcc5feaaa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c3608a731d199226408d3d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她在跑完比赛后，\n因身体状况恶化到极限而晕倒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a506e00b480799c977b9ca456cf11cc941d1b5d1f0a8400a51eca871299e7ee7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38b92b42ccca258dab49ecdb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "超级溪流接受医生的诊察，\n但因为找不到身体状况变差的原因，\n被警告应放弃参加春季经典赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f8f562e2bd888341699a40087e8b4822d53b412b37674b1b9dd770d43017755",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
