    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10bd27b3d9826d939540acfe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这让超级溪流因为无法把胜利献给训练员\n而泣不成声。\n两人暂时将目标定为秋季的“菊花赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08fa4a2c44deb2fbda7d182558863aaad4a6dde6c42ae4330ca8b08cfff50efc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
