      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然无法在“菊花赏”中获胜，\n但她透过经过经典赛有了丰富的收获。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36e4ccf540d8e6c95c88d7858462a43c64af827c634453d10e3d5549ced4729b",
